              "content": "*To learn more about calling atproto API endpoints like this one, see the [API Hosts and Auth](/docs/advanced-guides/api-directory) guide.*\n\nSubmit a moderation report regarding an atproto account or record. Implemented by moderation services (with PDS proxying), and requires auth.",
